~ start
Lola Ising: Is that you, iho?
Danilo: Oh, it’s you, Lola! You really startled me!
Lola Ising: What’s with the sudden visit home, iho? Where’s Wendy?
Lola Ising: [wave]I’ve been waiting so long for that child to come home.[/wave]
Danilo: I just happened to get home, that’s all.
Danilo: I didn’t tell Wendy because this wasn’t planned.
Lola Ising: Oh, I see, iho.
Lola Ising: Make sure to greet me through Wendy, okay?
Lola Ising: I really miss her.
Lola Ising: Alright then, let's part ways here... that long bus ride must’ve tired you out.
Danilo: Okay, Lola.
Danilo: ...
- Continue walking =>< nothing_happens
- Give Lola Ising some cash =>< given_money
=> END

~ nothing_happens
=> END

~ given_money
do SaveManager.set_given_lola_ising_cash(true)
Lola Ising: Oh dear! I won’t turn away this blessing. Thank you, iho!
Danilo: You’re welcome, Lola Ising.
=> END

~ lola_warning
Lola Ising: [wave]Be careful at night, iho.[/wave]
Lola Ising: Stay away from the forest if you can... it’s dark, twisted, and not welcoming.
Danilo: Thank you for the warning, Lola. I’ll go ahead first.
=> END

~ echoes
Danilo: ... [shake]Don’t go into the forest... [/shake]
=> END
